IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cptd-descriptions`

-- Consumer Protection (Trade Descriptions and Safety Requirements) Act 1975, ss 2, 4, 5, 11(3), 13, 14 to 17, 19 to 21, 24, 26(3), 31 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_consumer-protection-trade-descriptions-and-safety-requirements-act-1975.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a shop selling a ring stamped 916 that is 750 gold` MEANS Dealing WITH
    `is in the course of a trade or business` IS TRUE
    `applies the description or supplies goods bearing it` IS TRUE
    `the matter described` IS `fineness of gold or silver`
    `is false or likely to mislead` IS TRUE
    `in a material respect` IS TRUE
    `appears only in a newspaper, book, periodical, film or broadcast` IS FALSE
    `is or forms part of an advertisement` IS FALSE
    `is applied in accordance with a Schedule law` IS FALSE

